# NOTE: Import under [filter_remote] and assign policy with force-policy in Quantumult X.
#
# Combined AI routing rules for global and mainland-China AI services.
# Coverage: assistants/search, foundation-model APIs, coding/agents, image/video/audio,
# productivity/writing/meeting AI, model hosting/inference and major China AI platforms.
# Sources: existing Horatio rules + v2fly/domain-list-community + VPSDance/ai-proxy-rules
# + Repcz/Tool + selected official service domains.
# Shared third-party/CDN/analytics domains are intentionally excluded when they would
# over-match unrelated traffic. Place this AI rule before generic Google/Microsoft/GitHub/Meta rules.

